---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../../lib/siteConfig";

const updated = "March 26, 2026";
---

<Layout title="Terms and Conditions" description={`Terms and conditions for ${siteConfig.name}.`} noIndex>
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">Terms and Conditions</h1>
		<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-mute">Last updated {updated}</p>
		<div class="prose prose-neutral mt-8 max-w-none prose-headings:font-extrabold prose-headings:text-ink prose-p:text-body prose-li:text-body dark:prose-invert">
			<p>
				Welcome to {siteConfig.name}! By accessing and using our website, you agree to comply with
				and be bound by the following Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of
				these terms, please do not use our website.
			</p>
			<h2>Use of website</h2>
			<p>
				The content provided on {siteConfig.name} is for informational and educational purposes
				only. By using this website, you agree to:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Not use the website for any illegal or unauthorised purpose</li>
				<li>Not attempt to harm, hack, or disrupt the website</li>
				<li>Use the content responsibly and ethically</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>Financial disclaimer</h2>
			<p>
				All content related to stocks, cryptocurrency, forex, credit cards, and investments is for
				educational purposes only. We do not provide financial, investment, or trading advice. You
				are solely responsible for your financial decisions, and we recommend consulting a
				certified financial advisor before making any investments.
			</p>
			<h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
			<p>
				While we strive to provide accurate and up-to-date information, {siteConfig.name} makes no
				guarantees regarding the completeness, reliability, or accuracy of the content. Any action
				you take based on the information on this website is strictly at your own risk.
			</p>
			<h2>External links</h2>
			<p>
				Our website may contain links to external websites. We do not control or guarantee the
				content, accuracy, or reliability of these third-party websites and are not responsible for
				any losses or damages caused by them.
			</p>
			<h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
			<p>
				Some links on this website may be affiliate links. This means we may earn a small
				commission if you click on the link and make a purchase, at no extra cost to you. We only
				promote products and services that we believe provide value.
			</p>
			<h2>Intellectual property rights</h2>
			<p>
				All content on {siteConfig.name}, including text, graphics, logos, and images, is the
				property of the website unless otherwise stated. You may not copy, reproduce, or distribute
				content without permission, or use our content for commercial purposes without
				authorisation.
			</p>
			<h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
			<p>{siteConfig.name} will not be held liable for:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Any financial losses or damages</li>
				<li>Errors or omissions in content</li>
				<li>Website downtime or technical issues</li>
			</ul>
			<p>Your use of the website is at your own risk.</p>
			<h2>User-generated content</h2>
			<p>If you post comments or content on our website:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>You are responsible for what you post</li>
				<li>Content must not be offensive, illegal, or harmful</li>
				<li>We reserve the right to remove any content at our discretion</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>Changes to terms</h2>
			<p>We may update these Terms and Conditions at any time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>
			<h2>Termination of access</h2>
			<p>We reserve the right to restrict or terminate access to our website if users violate these terms.</p>
			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>
				Questions about these terms? Email us at
				<a href="mailto:bullorbearstrategies@gmail.com" class="font-semibold text-primary"
					>bullorbearstrategies@gmail.com</a
				> or <a href="/contact/" class="font-semibold text-primary">contact us</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
